      en: ["Kilinochchi was the administrative de facto capital of the LTTE from 1998 to 2009.", "The town is situated exactly on the A9 Kandy-Jaffna highway corridor.", "The Iranamadu Tank nearby provides irrigation for over 20,000 acres of paddy land.", "Sri Lankan government forces captured the town on January 2nd, 2009.", "The region is a major hub for rice production in the Northern Province.", "Post-war reconstruction includes the Kilinochchi General Hospital and public schools."],
